    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Super Dog Adventure</strong> is a local co-op platformer for 2\u20134 players. Team up with your friends on the same screen to jump, run, and solve puzzles as you battle through an exciting retro adventure!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Diverse and Rich Level Design</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Super Dog Adventure</i> features <strong>72 carefully crafted main levels</strong> and <strong>8 surprise bonus stages</strong>, each introducing new mechanics and challenges to keep the gameplay feeling fresh and exciting throughout.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764130/extras/9f795454262b91d3c98530476ed03813.poster.avif?t=1749629448\" width=800 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764130/extras/9f795454262b91d3c98530476ed03813.webm?t=1749629448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764130/extras/9f795454262b91d3c98530476ed03813.mp4?t=1749629448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Super Dog Takes the Stage!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Super Dog Adventure</i>, players take on the role of an agile and energetic Super Dog! Whether it's leaping over chasms, dodging traps, or working with teammates to solve puzzles, Super Dog is always leading the charge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764130/extras/fce13fd864640660d39f811298ea10c4.poster.avif?t=1749629448\" width=800 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764130/extras/fce13fd864640660d39f811298ea10c4.webm?t=1749629448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764130/extras/fce13fd864640660d39f811298ea10c4.mp4?t=1749629448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Varied Gameplay, Cooperation is Key!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game supports 2\u20134 player local co-op, allowing you and your friends to tackle challenges together\u2014or pull off a few pranks and sabotage each other for laughs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Super Dog Adventure</i> encourages teamwork, with each level set introducing new interactive mechanics such as door switches, pressure plates, and synchronized jumps to keep cooperation fun and engaging.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764130/extras/d3f90105538de6e6dca93875fb37971a.poster.avif?t=1749629448\" width=800 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764130/extras/d3f90105538de6e6dca93875fb37971a.webm?t=1749629448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764130/extras/d3f90105538de6e6dca93875fb37971a.mp4?t=1749629448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Clear the Blocks, Open the Path</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step on switches or activate items to remove the blocks blocking your way, creating a safe passage for the team. Will you go first, or let your teammates lead the way?<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764130/extras/736f62de9b96743e15afb6dc43a35c15.poster.avif?t=1749629448\" width=800 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764130/extras/736f62de9b96743e15afb6dc43a35c15.webm?t=1749629448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764130/extras/736f62de9b96743e15afb6dc43a35c15.mp4?t=1749629448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Camera Focus</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One player must take on the role of the &quot;cameraperson,&quot; controlling the view to keep everyone on screen. Only by staying in sync can the team move forward smoothly!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764130/extras/d9865f38ea3d99fc513e1dc31dfe56a1.poster.avif?t=1749629448\" width=800 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764130/extras/d9865f38ea3d99fc513e1dc31dfe56a1.webm?t=1749629448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764130/extras/d9865f38ea3d99fc513e1dc31dfe56a1.mp4?t=1749629448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Turbo Ride, Speed Through</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hop into a turbo vehicle and race at full speed\u2014hesitate for a moment, and you'll be left behind! Time your moves and cooperate left and right to break through every obstacle!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764130/extras/7d2dac3caa25fdafee894dc05a0002af.poster.avif?t=1749629448\" width=800 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764130/extras/7d2dac3caa25fdafee894dc05a0002af.webm?t=1749629448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764130/extras/7d2dac3caa25fdafee894dc05a0002af.mp4?t=1749629448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Vertical Climb, Spike Dodge</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ascend through a constantly rising level while dodging deadly spikes! Under pressure, the team must quickly choose the right path. Will it end in a wipeout or a perfect clear? It all depends on your teamwork!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764130/extras/670aacd8e54d3f1535ae82cda28a87c3.poster.avif?t=1749629448\" width=800 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764130/extras/670aacd8e54d3f1535ae82cda28a87c3.webm?t=1749629448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764130/extras/670aacd8e54d3f1535ae82cda28a87c3.mp4?t=1749629448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Super Dog Adventure</strong> is a local co-op platformer for 2\u20134 players. Team up with your friends on the same screen to jump, run, and solve puzzles as you battle through an exciting retro adventure!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Diverse and Rich Level Design</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Super Dog Adventure</i> features <strong>72 carefully crafted main levels</strong> and <strong>8 surprise bonus stages</strong>, each introducing new mechanics and challenges to keep the gameplay feeling fresh and exciting throughout.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764130/extras/9f795454262b91d3c98530476ed03813.poster.avif?t=1749629448\" width=800 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764130/extras/9f795454262b91d3c98530476ed03813.webm?t=1749629448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764130/extras/9f795454262b91d3c98530476ed03813.mp4?t=1749629448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Super Dog Takes the Stage!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Super Dog Adventure</i>, players take on the role of an agile and energetic Super Dog! Whether it's leaping over chasms, dodging traps, or working with teammates to solve puzzles, Super Dog is always leading the charge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764130/extras/fce13fd864640660d39f811298ea10c4.poster.avif?t=1749629448\" width=800 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764130/extras/fce13fd864640660d39f811298ea10c4.webm?t=1749629448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764130/extras/fce13fd864640660d39f811298ea10c4.mp4?t=1749629448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Varied Gameplay, Cooperation is Key!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game supports 2\u20134 player local co-op, allowing you and your friends to tackle challenges together\u2014or pull off a few pranks and sabotage each other for laughs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Super Dog Adventure</i> encourages teamwork, with each level set introducing new interactive mechanics such as door switches, pressure plates, and synchronized jumps to keep cooperation fun and engaging.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764130/extras/d3f90105538de6e6dca93875fb37971a.poster.avif?t=1749629448\" width=800 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764130/extras/d3f90105538de6e6dca93875fb37971a.webm?t=1749629448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764130/extras/d3f90105538de6e6dca93875fb37971a.mp4?t=1749629448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Clear the Blocks, Open the Path</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step on switches or activate items to remove the blocks blocking your way, creating a safe passage for the team. Will you go first, or let your teammates lead the way?<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764130/extras/736f62de9b96743e15afb6dc43a35c15.poster.avif?t=1749629448\" width=800 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764130/extras/736f62de9b96743e15afb6dc43a35c15.webm?t=1749629448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764130/extras/736f62de9b96743e15afb6dc43a35c15.mp4?t=1749629448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Camera Focus</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One player must take on the role of the &quot;cameraperson,&quot; controlling the view to keep everyone on screen. Only by staying in sync can the team move forward smoothly!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764130/extras/d9865f38ea3d99fc513e1dc31dfe56a1.poster.avif?t=1749629448\" width=800 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764130/extras/d9865f38ea3d99fc513e1dc31dfe56a1.webm?t=1749629448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764130/extras/d9865f38ea3d99fc513e1dc31dfe56a1.mp4?t=1749629448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Turbo Ride, Speed Through</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hop into a turbo vehicle and race at full speed\u2014hesitate for a moment, and you'll be left behind! Time your moves and cooperate left and right to break through every obstacle!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764130/extras/7d2dac3caa25fdafee894dc05a0002af.poster.avif?t=1749629448\" width=800 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764130/extras/7d2dac3caa25fdafee894dc05a0002af.webm?t=1749629448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764130/extras/7d2dac3caa25fdafee894dc05a0002af.mp4?t=1749629448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Vertical Climb, Spike Dodge</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ascend through a constantly rising level while dodging deadly spikes! Under pressure, the team must quickly choose the right path. Will it end in a wipeout or a perfect clear? It all depends on your teamwork!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764130/extras/670aacd8e54d3f1535ae82cda28a87c3.poster.avif?t=1749629448\" width=800 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764130/extras/670aacd8e54d3f1535ae82cda28a87c3.webm?t=1749629448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764130/extras/670aacd8e54d3f1535ae82cda28a87c3.mp4?t=1749629448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
